        "86993e9d-47da-5903-a5fd-ad3a3fd3d8c2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "instruction": "Steam for 15 minutes. (If you haven’t got a steamer, put the parcel on a heatproof plate over a pan of gently simmering water, cover with a lid and steam.)",
      "timer_seconds": 900
    }
